    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184250/extras/92ae8bc818d8227f540da6361f69eba1.poster.avif?t=1755558217\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184250/extras/92ae8bc818d8227f540da6361f69eba1.webm?t=1755558217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184250/extras/92ae8bc818d8227f540da6361f69eba1.mp4?t=1755558217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snake but you gotta go DEEP </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat apples</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your body</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All-time and daily leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GO DEEPER</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird trippy geometry</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EVEN DEEPER</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEEPER</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-Euclidean space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ENTER THE VOID</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184250/extras/92ae8bc818d8227f540da6361f69eba1.poster.avif?t=1755558217\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184250/extras/92ae8bc818d8227f540da6361f69eba1.webm?t=1755558217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184250/extras/92ae8bc818d8227f540da6361f69eba1.mp4?t=1755558217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snake but you gotta go DEEP </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat apples</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your body</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All-time and daily leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GO DEEPER</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weird trippy geometry</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EVEN DEEPER</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge obstacles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEEPER</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Non-Euclidean space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ENTER THE VOID</p></li></ul>",
